WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.959 --> 00:00:03.584
When he got up that morning

00:00:03.584 --> 00:00:05.750
He did not plan on robbing a bank.

00:00:07.459 --> 00:00:10.578
On September 30, 1993, two
gunmen took three employees

00:00:10.578 --> 00:00:12.885
hostage at a Chase
Manhattan Bank in Brooklyn.

00:00:15.224 --> 00:00:18.060
It was my first time as
an FBI hostage negotiator.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:21.586
We didn't expect the bad guy
to be really manipulative.

00:00:22.541 --> 00:00:24.258
PERP #1: We're not going by those plans.

00:00:24.258 --> 00:00:25.215
CHRIS VOSS: Hello, this is Chris.

00:00:25.215 --> 00:00:27.011
Who am I speaking to please?

00:00:27.011 --> 00:00:29.180
PERP #2: Don't you talk to
somebody, okay, all right?

00:00:29.180 --> 00:00:30.723
CHRIS VOSS: Okay, I'm
talking, I'm talking to you.

00:00:35.713 --> 00:00:39.739
I get handed a note saying, talk
to him about him coming out.

00:00:41.503 --> 00:00:43.547
He knows that I'm his way out.

00:00:45.366 --> 00:00:49.871
And whether those three people
lived or died was on me.

